      "content": "<p>The correct order of electron gain enthalpies of Cl, F, Te and Po is</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "F < Cl < Te < Po"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "Po < Te < F < Cl"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "Te < Po < Cl < F"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "Cl < F < Te < Po"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "Te → –190 kJ mol<sup>–1</sup><br/><br/>\nPo → –174 kJ mol<sup>–1</sup><br/><br/>\nF → –333 kJ mol<sup>–1</sup><br/><br/>\nCl → –349 kJ mol<sup>–1</sup><br/><br/>\nHence, correct order is Cl > F > Te > Po"
